### EmitterComponent

# Shows when attempting to turn the emitter on or off without proper access
comp-emitter-access-locked = { $target } 已被鎖定，無法存取！
# Shows when turning the emitter on/off
comp-emitter-turned-on = { $target } 隨即亮起。
comp-emitter-turned-off = { $target } 關閉。
# Shows if the user attempts to activate the emitter while it's un-anchored.
comp-emitter-not-anchored = 這個 { $target } 並沒有固定在地面上！
# Upgrades
emitter-component-upgrade-fire-rate = 射速
emitter-component-current-type = 目前選取的類型是：{ $type }。
emitter-component-type-set = 字型設定為：{ $type }
